{
  "_comment": "Anima txt2img + AnimaSelectiveLoRALoader (exploración por bloques). Placeholders: model, text_encoder, vae, lora, lora_strength, prompt, negative, seed, steps, cfg, sampler, scheduler, width, height. Los toggles/dosis (block_N / block_N_str / llm_adapter / other_weights) los inyecta explore.py mutando inputs del nodo 10 — OJO: el nodo escala lora_down y lora_up (y alpha si existe), así que la dosis actúa al cuadrado (o cubo con alpha); explore.py pasa dosis**(1/exponente) para que sea lineal.",
  "1": {
    "class_type": "UNETLoader",
    "inputs": { "unet_name": "{{model}}", "weight_dtype": "default" }
  },
  "2": {
    "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
    "inputs": { "clip_name": "{{text_encoder}}", "type": "cosmos" }
  },
  "3": {
    "class_type": "VAELoader",
    "inputs": { "vae_name": "{{vae}}" }
  },
  "10": {
    "class_type": "AnimaSelectiveLoRALoader",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["1", 0],
      "clip": ["2", 0],
      "lora_name": "{{lora}}",
      "strength": "{{lora_strength}}",
      "preset": "Custom"
    }
  },
  "4": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": { "text": "{{prompt}}", "clip": ["10", 1] }
  },
  "5": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": { "text": "{{negative}}", "clip": ["10", 1] }
  },
  "6": {
    "class_type": "EmptySD3LatentImage",
    "inputs": { "width": "{{width}}", "height": "{{height}}", "batch_size": 1 }
  },
  "7": {
    "class_type": "KSampler",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["10", 0],
      "positive": ["4", 0],
      "negative": ["5", 0],
      "latent_image": ["6", 0],
      "seed": "{{seed}}",
      "steps": "{{steps}}",
      "cfg": "{{cfg}}",
      "sampler_name": "{{sampler}}",
      "scheduler": "{{scheduler}}",
      "denoise": 1.0
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "class_type": "VAEDecode",
    "inputs": { "samples": ["7", 0], "vae": ["3", 0] }
  },
  "9": {
    "class_type": "SaveImage",
    "inputs": { "images": ["8", 0], "filename_prefix": "forge_lab" }
  }
}
